@startuml Supervisor USER_NOTIF flow
!theme spacelab
skinparam shadowing false
title Supervisor: only the interpreter replies to the kernel

rectangle "Sandboxed JVM" as jvm
rectangle "USER_NOTIF" as notif
rectangle "SupervisorRouteDispatcher" as dispatcher
rectangle "Private route helpers" as route
rectangle "Effect" as effect
rectangle "Interpreter" as interp
rectangle "Kernel CONTINUE / EPERM / ADDFD" as kernel

jvm --> notif : seccomp listener
notif --> dispatcher : parsed syscall
dispatcher --> route : prepare + execute
route --> dispatcher : planned reply
dispatcher --> effect : terminal effect
effect --> interp : owned FDs + verdict
interp --> kernel : terminal reply

note bottom of jvm
  JVM verdict is validated in-process.
  The sidecar must not consume a second
  authorization store.
  Only the dispatcher reaches route helpers.
end note

@enduml
